    <briefdescription>
<para>DSPy module that prepends chain-of-thought reasoning instructions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Automatically injects a &quot;Reasoning&quot; output field before the declared output fields so the model reasons step-by-step before producing its final outputs.</para>
<para>The intermediate reasoning is captured in the &quot;Reasoning&quot; key of the returned map alongside the declared output fields. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
